     : ProjectionExec: expr=[id@2 as col_1, parent_id@1 as col_2, NULL as col_3, NULL as col_4, ctid_0@0 as ctid_0, ctid_1@4 as ctid_1]
     :   GlobalLimitExec: skip=0, fetch=2
     :     VisibilityFilterExec: tables=[c, p]
     :       HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Inner, on=[(id@1, parent_id@1)], filter=(__c_0_tag_0@1 OR __p_1_tag_0@3) AND id@0 + id@2 > 0, projection=[ctid_0@3, parent_id@4, id@5, pdb.vector_score(c)@6, ctid_1@0]
     :         CooperativeExec
